WEBVTT

00:05:58.050 --> 00:06:01.200
In the end, 300 people were gravely wounded

00:06:01.200 --> 00:06:05.105
and over 172 men, women and children

00:06:05.105 --> 00:06:09.456
lost their lives that day.

00:06:09.456 --> 00:06:11.221
Think about what happened.

00:06:11.221 --> 00:06:14.232
During this 60-hour siege on Mumbai,

00:06:14.232 --> 00:06:18.647
10 men armed not just with weapons,

00:06:18.647 --> 00:06:20.541
but with technology,

00:06:20.541 --> 00:06:24.071
were able to bring a city of 20 million people

00:06:24.071 --> 00:06:26.233
to a standstill.

00:06:26.233 --> 00:06:28.203
Ten people brought 20 million people

00:06:28.203 --> 00:06:32.397
to a standstill, and this traveled around the world.